<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Welcome</title>
    <style>
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        body {
            min-height: 100vh; color: #f1f1fb; line-height: 1.5;
            font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;
            background:
                radial-gradient(620px 420px at 8% 0%, rgba(217,70,239,.38), transparent 60%),
                radial-gradient(520px 420px at 100% 35%, rgba(34,211,238,.28), transparent 60%),
                radial-gradient(640px 420px at 40% 100%, rgba(99,102,241,.38), transparent 60%),
                #07070f;
        }
        .wrap { max-width: 1040px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }
        header { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 26px 0; }
        .brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.2rem; color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
        .logo { width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 9px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e879f9, #22d3ee); }
        nav { display: flex; gap: 4px; padding: 5px; border-radius: 999px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.06); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1); }
        nav a { text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: .9rem; padding: 9px 20px; border-radius: 999px; color: rgba(255,255,255,.7); }
        nav a.solid { background: #fff; color: #000; }
        .main { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 50px; align-items: center; padding: 60px 0; }
        .tag { display: inline-block; padding: 7px 16px; border-radius: 999px; font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .2em; text-transform: uppercase;
               color: #67e8f9; background: rgba(255,255,255,.06); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1); }
        h1 { font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 4.6rem); line-height: 1.02; letter-spacing: -.035em; font-weight: 800; margin: 22px 0 20px; }
        .grad { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #f0abfc, #c4b5fd, #67e8f9); -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; color: transparent; }
        .lead { color: rgba(255,255,255,.55); font-size: 1.1rem; max-width: 440px; }
        .actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px; margin-top: 34px; }
        .btn { display: inline-block; padding: 14px 32px; border-radius: 999px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; }
        .primary { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d946ef, #6366f1); box-shadow: 0 0 40px -6px rgba(217,70,239,.6); }
        .ghost { background: rgba(255,255,255,.07); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18); }
        .stats { display: flex; gap: 34px; margin-top: 44px; padding-top: 28px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1); }
        .stats strong { display: block; font-size: 1.6rem; }
        .stats small { color: rgba(255,255,255,.4); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em; font-size: .7rem; }
        .panel { padding: 26px; border-radius: 26px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.06); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);
                 box-shadow: 0 30px 60px -20px rgba(0,0,0,.7); }
        .dots span { display: inline-block; width: 11px; height: 11px; border-radius: 50%; margin-right: 6px; }
        .dots span:nth-child(1) { background: #f87171; } .dots span:nth-child(2) { background: #fbbf24; } .dots span:nth-child(3) { background: #4ade80; }
        .big { font-size: 2.8rem; font-weight: 800; margin: 18px 0 4px; letter-spacing: -.02em; }
        .sub { color: rgba(255,255,255,.4); font-size: .75rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .15em; }
        .chart { display: flex; align-items: flex-end; gap: 8px; height: 90px; margin: 20px 0 22px; }
        .chart i { flex: 1; border-radius: 6px 6px 0 0; background: linear-gradient(to top, #d946ef, #67e8f9); }
        .row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 12px 14px; margin-top: 10px; border-radius: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.05); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08); font-size: .9rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,.8); }
        .tick { width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 50%; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: .75rem; color: #67e8f9; background: rgba(34,211,238,.18); }
        footer { text-align: center; padding: 26px 0 34px; color: rgba(255,255,255,.35); font-size: .8rem; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="wrap">
        <header>
            <a href="/" class="brand"><span class="logo"></span> My App</a>
            <nav>
                <a href="/login">Log in</a>
                <a href="/register" class="solid">Register</a>
            </nav>
        </header>

        <main class="main">
            <div>
                <span class="tag">Welcome</span>
                <h1>Design the<br><span class="grad">future, today.</span></h1>
                <p class="lead">A sleek, glowing home for your project. Jump back in or create an account to begin.</p>
                <div class="actions">
                    <a href="/register" class="btn primary">Get started</a>
                    <a href="/login" class="btn ghost">Log in</a>
                </div>
                <div class="stats">
                    <div><strong>99.9%</strong><small>Uptime</small></div>
                    <div><strong>&lt;1s</strong><small>Load time</small></div>
                    <div><strong>24/7</strong><small>Access</small></div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="panel">
                <div class="dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
                <div class="big">1,284</div>
                <div class="sub">Overview</div>
                <div class="chart">
                    <i style="height:40%"></i><i style="height:65%"></i><i style="height:45%"></i><i style="height:80%"></i>
                    <i style="height:55%"></i><i style="height:95%"></i><i style="height:70%"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="row"><span class="tick">&#10003;</span> Authentication ready</div>
                <div class="row"><span class="tick">&#10003;</span> Responsive layout</div>
                <div class="row"><span class="tick">&#10003;</span> Everything is running</div>
            </div>
        </main>

        <footer>&copy; 2026 My App</footer>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
